    "description": "Complete REST collection for the Seminar Hall Booking System (Go/Gin).\n\n## Import\n1. Postman → **Import** → select this file and `Seminar-Hall-Booking-API.postman_environment.json`.\n2. Select environment **Seminar Hall Booking (Local)** (`baseUrl` = `http://localhost:8080`).\n3. Start the backend (`cd backend && go run main.go`).\n4. Run **Auth → Login as Admin** (or Coordinator / Requester). Tests save JWT to `{{token}}`.\n\n## Seed logins (after `go run ./cmd/seed`)\n| Role | Username | Password |\n|------|----------|----------|\n| admin | `admin` | `admin123` |\n| dept_coordinator | `coordinator1` | `coord123` |\n| requester | `student1` | `req123` |\n\nProtected folders send `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`. The API also accepts cookie `auth_token` from browsers.\n\nSource: `backend/internal/router/router.go`.",
